  "answer_text": "It looks like there are several pools named \"Glenwood Pool\" across the United States! Here's a summary of the most notable ones:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 1. Glenwood Hot Springs Resort \u2013 Glenwood Springs, CO\nThe historic Glenwood Hot Springs Resort is home to the **world's largest hot springs pool**, with more than 7 expansive pools on the property. The historic thermal spring water has been drawing visitors from all over the world since 1888.\n\n- The source of the mineral water is the **Yampah Spring**, which produces over 3.5 million gallons of water per day at a temperature of 122\u00b0F.\n- The Grand Pool contains over **1 million gallons of water** and is an aquatic playground for kids of all ages.\n- Passes include full access to all pools, including the Grand Pool, the Hot Therapy Pool, Sopris Splash Zone, and Hanging Lake Falls Pool.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 2. Glenwood Pool \u2013 Forest Glen, Maryland\nGlenwood Pool is a **swim club** set back among the trees and along a creek in historic **Forest Glen, Maryland**. They welcome new members and can be contacted at board@glenwoodpool.org.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 3. Glenwood Houses Pool \u2013 Brooklyn, New York\nLocated in the **Glenwood Houses neighborhood of Brooklyn, New York**, this pool offers a place to cool off and enjoy the water during the hot New York summers.\n- Managed by **NYC Parks**, it is a well-maintained facility catering to the community's aquatic needs.\n- It is located at **Farragut Road & Ralph Avenue** and can be reached at (718) 531-2480.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 4. Glenwood Aquatic Center \u2013 Glenwood Springs, CO (City Pool)\nThis city-run pool boasts **8 lap lanes** and a one-meter diving board, ranging from 4 to 12 feet deep, with a temperature kept between 82\u201384\u00b0F.\n- It is located at **100 Wulfsohn Road, Glenwood Springs, CO 81601**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfca 5. Glennwood Pool \u2013 Evans, Georgia\nGlennwood Pool is a **non-profit, volunteer-run neighborhood pool** in Evans, Georgia, offering memberships for residents and non-residents, seasonal events like dive-in movie nights, and military & senior discounts.\n\n---\n\nCould you clarify which **Glenwood Pool** you're looking for? I'd be happy to provide more specific details! \ud83d\ude0a",
